<title>USA: Carolina Fincorp Q2 Dec 31 net increases.</title>
<headline>Carolina Fincorp Q2 Dec 31 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>ROCKINGHAM, N.C. 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Carolina Fincorp Inc said its net income for the first quarter of 1996 was $271,000, as compared to $154,000 in 1995.</p>
<p>Net income for the first six months of 1996 was $77,000, as compared to $307,000 in 1995.</p>
<p>The net income for the first six months of 1996 included a special assessment by the Federal Deposit Insurance Corp on SAIF insured deposits. Without the special assessment, net income would have been approximately $420,000.</p>
</text>
